{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06525","headline":"游茅山五首 五 · 储光羲","name":"游茅山五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名岳徵仙事，清都访道书。\n山门入松柏，天路涵空虚。\n南极见朝采，西潭闻夜渔。\n远心尚云宿，浪迹出林居。\n爲己存实际，忘形同化初。\n此行良已矣，不乐复何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}